---
description: Persisting data and database migrations
globs: *.ts
alwaysApply: false
---
   Database migrations follow a specific pattern:
   - update relevant altv/prisma/schema/*.prisma files
   - run `bun run prisma:generate` in altv/ dir
   - run `bun run migration:create migration_description` in altv/ dir
   - open generated `altv/migrations/yyyy-mm-dd_migration_description/index.ts` file
   - Use prisma.*.findRaw() to get existing related to migrations data (usually character model)
   - Use prisma.$runCommandRaw() for MongoDB updates to avoid outdated schema validation
   